---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok 3 Day 2 Night Tour – Rainforest Adventure"
  description="khao Sok 3 day 2 night tour. Stay at Riverside Cottages and the lake. Experience awesome nature and scenery on this khao Sok 3 day tour."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/GrandAdventure_Package_Tours_Lake_MG_7772_crop.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok 3 Day 2 Night Tour – Rainforest Adventure"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Lake Tour Rainforest", "href": "/khao-sok-lake-tour-rainforest/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Rainforest Adventure</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Khao Sok 3 day 2 night tour staying both nights at Riverside Cottages with a full day tour on the lake. Experience the wonders of the national park!</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 1: </strong>Arrive Khao Sok Riverside Cottages for check in and orientation, and be shown to your room. In the afternoon, explore the river with a <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">guided canoe trip</a>, or, if the river level is high enough, hop on top of a rubber ring for a <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">tubing adventure</a>. At the end of the day, continue your khao Sok 3 day 2 night tour with a <a href="/khao-sok-night-safari/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">night safari</a> to look for nocturnal wildlife or skip the night hike and get a one hour Thai massage.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 2: </strong>On day 2, after breakfast, it's time for a tour of the lake. Enjoy a full breakfast and then embark on an <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/#fulldaylake" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">all-day trip to Cheow Larn Lake</a>. You will take a boat through incredible scenery to a floating bungalow. After lunch, swim in the emerald waters and go for a jungle hike or go kayaking. Return to Riverside Cottages at sunset.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>Day 3: </strong>In the morning, have breakfast and then stay active with a half day hike in Khao Sok National park, or take a short drive to a scenic viewpoint and the nearby hot springs. Program ends with checkout at 12:00pm.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Please visit our page: <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Larn Lake tours</a>, for information on the all-day lake trip!</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Price does not include entrance fee to Khao Sok National Park<strong>.</strong></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Includes breakfast + lunch on Day 2, and breakfast on Day 3.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="my-12">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <figure class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50 group">
